{"id": "86334", "name": "אינטגרל של 1 חלקי שורש של ריבועית – השלמה לריבוע (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Complete the square in the quadratic expression q which is given by</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ q= {{CT:0}}, \\]</p><p>and use this to evaluate the following integral</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( \\displaystyle \\int {{CT:1}}d{{CT:2}} = \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> Complete the square, substitute a hyperbolic sine for the inner expression and use \\(\\cosh^2(u)-\\sinh^2(u)=1\\).</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — Completing the square</b><br><p>Completing the square for q gives</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ q={{CT:3}}{{CT:4}} + {{CT:5}}{{CT:2}} + {{CT:6}}={{CT:3}}{{CT:4}}+ {{CT:7}}{{CT:2}}+{{CT:8}}+{{CT:9}}=({{CT:10}}{{CT:2}}+{{CT:11}})^2 + {{CT:9}} \\]</p><p>Therefore</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\int{{CT:1}}d{{CT:2}} = \\int\\frac{1}{{CT:12}}d{{CT:2}}=\\int\\frac{1}{{CT:13}}d{{CT:2}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — A hyperbolic substitution</b><br><p>Let \\({{CT:14}}+{{CT:15}} = \\sinh(u)\\) giving</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ d{{CT:2}} = {{CT:16}}du \\]</p><p>Therefore</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\int{{CT:1}}d{{CT:2}} = \\int\\frac{1}{{CT:17}}{{CT:18}}du \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 3 — Integrate</b><br><p>and since \\(\\cosh^2(u)-\\sinh^2(u) = 1\\)</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\begin{aligned} \\int\\frac{1}{{CT:19}}{{CT:20}}du&= \\int\\frac{1}{{CT:21}}{{CT:20}}du\\\\ \\int \\frac{du}{{CT:10}}&= \\frac{u}{{CT:10}} + c \\\\ &= {{CT:22}} \\end{aligned} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "integrate", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 3, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "Int", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": " v1", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "diff(f1,v1)", "testoptions": "v", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["c0", "correctanswer", "f1", "n0", "n1", "q1", "v1"], "nvariants": 50}